--- !u!114 &114958343318402985
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1696130270416439}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 577
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 嗯...以{$daoyou}显露出来的修为，去海上闯一闯应该不是什么难事，不过还是要十分小心。即便是身经百战的蓬莎到修士出海，仍有舟毁人亡的风险，这种事我们见得太多了。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114315998945265487}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
